## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
##+Q 65536

## Tweak GC to run more often
##-env ERL_FULLSWEEP_AFTER 10

# apps/mehungry_app/rel/remote.vm.args.eex

## Cookie
# IMPORTANT: Remove or comment out any hardcoded cookie here
# Let the environment variable take precedence
-setcookie ${ERLANG_COOKIE}

## Node name
-name ${RELEASE_NODE}

## Kernel options
-smp auto

## Increase distribution buffer
+zdbbl 32768

## Port range for distribution
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9000
-kernel inet_dist_listen_max 9100

## Heartbeat for VM monitoring
-heart

## Run as a long-lived node
+Bi

## Enable distributed signals
+sfwi -sbt db

## Number of async threads for IO
+A 5
